// -------------------------------------------------------------------
// Adjusted Voce parameters for IF-steel
//
// Changes from previous:
//   h_0:  1000 -> 500 MPa   (less aggressive initial hardening,
//                             closer to dislocation-density model
//                             which hardens more gradually)
//   tau_S: 360 -> 250 MPa   (lower saturation so hardening is still
//                             active at 25% — prevents over-stiffening
//                             that suppresses deformation heterogeneity)
//   k_exponent: 20 -> 30    (more rate-insensitive — the paper's
//                             dislocation model is nearly rate-independent)
//   gammadot_0: 25e3 -> 50e3 (increase to reduce overstress at high
//                              strain rate with higher k_exponent)
// -------------------------------------------------------------------
